{"id":"3424cb7ed13e3899","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-order10-equivalence-kernel-of-preorder.md","title":"ZFC Order10 Equivalence Kernel Of Preorder","display":"df-zfc-order10-equivalence-kernel-of-preorder — ZFC Order10 Equivalence Kernel Of Preorder","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order10-equivalence-kernel-of-preorder","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order10-equivalence-kernel-of-preorder"],"display":"df-zfc-order10-equivalence-kernel-of-preorder — ZFC Order10 Equivalence Kernel Of Preorder","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-order6-preorder.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order10-equivalence-kernel-of-preorder"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order10-equivalence-kernel-of-preorder</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order10-equivalence-kernel-of-preorder — ZFC Order10 Equivalence Kernel Of Preorder"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e0308c920cba2bdd\" href=\"?note=e0308c920cba2bdd\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-order6-preorder.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-order6-preorder.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,P \\in V\">\\(E,P \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq\\;\\subseteq P\\times P\">\\(\\preceq\\;\\subseteq P\\times P\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Preorder}(P,\\preceq)\">\\(\\operatorname{Preorder}(P,\\preceq)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e0308c920cba2bdd\" href=\"?note=e0308c920cba2bdd\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-order6-preorder.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-order6-preorder.md</a> 的规范定义</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10EquivalenceKernelOfPreorder}_S \\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10EquivalenceKernelOfPreorder}_S \\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}kernel\\text{-}of\\text{-}preorder} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder10EquivalenceKernelOfPreorder}_S(E,P,\\preceq)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Preorder}(P,\\preceq)\\land E=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in P\\times P:x\\preceq y\\land y\\preceq x\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}kernel\\text{-}of\\text{-}preorder} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder10EquivalenceKernelOfPreorder}_S(E,P,\\preceq)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Preorder}(P,\\preceq)\\land E=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in P\\times P:x\\preceq y\\land y\\preceq x\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>预序的反对称化以互相可达关系为等价核；预序公理保证该关系确为等价关系。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-order6-preorder.md","status":"resolved","id":"e0308c920cba2bdd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-order6-preorder.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-order6-preorder.md","status":"resolved","id":"e0308c920cba2bdd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Preorder}(P,\\preceq)$ 采用 [[../batch13/58-df-zfc-order6-preorder.md]] 的规范定义","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"E,P \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\preceq\\;\\subseteq P\\times P","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Preorder}(P,\\preceq)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10EquivalenceKernelOfPreorder}_S \\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}kernel\\text{-}of\\text{-}preorder} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder10EquivalenceKernelOfPreorder}_S(E,P,\\preceq)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Preorder}(P,\\preceq)\\land E=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in P\\times P:x\\preceq y\\land y\\preceq x\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1126,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2861","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-order10-equivalence-kernel-of-preorder.md|58-df-zfc-order10-equivalence-kernel-of-preorder]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","e0308c920cba2bdd"]}